        "PMC10026765::web::015::flow_curves_after_hot_deformation",
        "PMC7961501::web::016::4_1_mechanical_responses_during_hot_comp"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher temperature or lower strain rate provides sufficient thermal activation and time for boundary migration and DRX.",
